config IIO_BCM4775_SHUB
	tristate "Broadcom BCM4775 sensor hub (Samsung SSP)"
	depends on SPI && OF
	select FW_LOADER
	select IIO_BUFFER
	select IIO_TRIGGERED_BUFFER
	help
	  The BCM4775 GNSS/sensor hub in Samsung Galaxy S10 phones. It needs
	  a RAM patch (brcm/bcm4775-shub.patch) on every power-up. The
	  accelerometer, light, proximity and compass it runs are exposed
	  as IIO devices.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called bcm4775-shub.
